
 forward the port and give it to docs


forward 8080 1L


 🤖 Port 8080 is now forwarded to http://127.82.233.168:8080.


forward docs:8080 1L


 🤖 Port 8080 now belongs to job docs.


Port 8080 now belongs to docs.


 give it to docs again, then to the api


forward docs:8080 1L
forward api:8080 ✗ 1L port 8080 is already forwarded

Port 8080 stays with docs.
